{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこでカンニングして設楽さんに怒られました能條です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/3658116/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしゃカンニングなんかしてなーーーーーーいっ!!!(*｀へ´*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当本当！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえーねえー聞いてー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の友達が、あみの誕生日が近いからということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然あみにサプライズでハッピーバースデーの歌を歌ってもらったの❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、こんなものをみんなからもらいました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/3658116/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかげそ、めかぶ、えびせん、ロールケーキ、いもケーキ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーんどういう意図なんだろう...？笑（ちなみに、いとじゃなくていずと読むのにハマってます）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達Ｎ「あみはさ、気分屋さんだからさぁ、ロールケーキ食べて飽きたらめかぶ食べてしょっぱいもの食べてさぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいでさぁ、次に絶対いもケーキ食べるでしょ？しょっぱいもの欲しくなるはずだからそしたらいかげそ食べて！！！ね！？わかった！？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じのくだりで全部ありがたく頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものすごい気遣いありがとうね(*^^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何より先日の握手会で頂いたプレゼントとか手紙、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部大事に大事に使わせていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手紙も一文一文大切に読まさせていだだきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱあみはあみあみ族の皆さんが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......改めて言うとわりかし照れるね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、でも本当よ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみって何かミステリアスというか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議な雰囲気がするケド言われた事ない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーーー不思議な雰囲気だとは結構言われるなあ  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜゆえ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、エアー握手会やってくれませんか？あみあみ不足の症状が出始めてるんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.おっ！それは大変だ  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回やろおっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、お誕生日プレゼントは、なにが嬉しいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.お洋服とかコスメとか？かな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！女子力が上がるものとかだとテンションも上がっちゃうよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ケーキとパン作れます.あみあみは、作れる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.パン作ったことないっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキはねえ、何度かあるんやでえ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみちやんは恋愛面で、愛したい派？愛されたい派？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うーんどうなんだろ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分愛されたい方だと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.サッカーとかやったら接触プレーとかでアザが出来るのは分かるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスでアザができるってのはどうやったらなるんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.激しいダンスとか、ひざをつくヒップホップ系のダンスだとアザできちゃうっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、自分はさゆりん推しなんやけど、握手しに行ったら迷惑かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ぜーんぜんいいのよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首を長くして待ってるよん (๑╹∀╹๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、チームNは隊長？総長？監督？班長？組長？部長？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみはどんな呼び方がいいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ううん、そんなおかたい呼び方はいらないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に能條さんでいいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、こう言うアイドルのファンも卒業した方がいいのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.自分の気持ちに正直にっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ応援したいっていう気持ちがあるならとことん応援してね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、休みの日なにしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.友達とあそぶか寝るか寝るか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでじゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/3658116/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃまた今度ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみんなが大好き！"}],"source":"archive"}